{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1571","id":4059320871,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87x9FIn","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1571","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1571.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1571.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1571","number":1571,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[V1][P0][AUTH-01] Mount and harden custom-JWT application auth","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- mount the existing backend custom-JWT `AuthProvider` at the app root and register all internal `/learn/**` routes behind an explicit protected boundary\n- complete access/refresh lifecycle behavior: proactive refresh, one retry after protected API `401`, cross-tab invalidation, remote refresh-session revocation on logout, and fail-closed production session persistence\n- harden JWT verification to fixed `HS256`, issuer `cie-copilot`, audience `cie-users`, valid signature, and a required non-expired `exp`\n- remove the Supabase Auth fallback path entirely from trusted runtime auth, including when the retired fallback flag is set\n- redact auth mail/error logs, remove preview/link returns, and keep service-role credentials server-only\n- update auth runtime documentation and configuration guidance\n\n## Acceptance evidence\n\n- root provider and protected learning-route contracts are covered\n- custom-JWT signature, issuer, audience, expiry, missing-expiry, unauthorized, refresh, logout, and production session failures are covered\n- real API gateway E2E passes with a non-production identity; unauthorized, wrong-issuer, wrong-audience, and expired tokens all return `401`\n- production browser build passes and the client-bundle service-role/JWT scan reports 4 assets, 0 findings\n- targeted auth/runtime suite: 11 suites, 160 tests passed\n- API gateway integration suite: 9 tests passed\n- changed-file ESLint: passed\n- production Vite build: passed\n- `git diff --check`: passed\n\n## Boundary\n\nNo remote Supabase, Storage, Vector, or RAG writes were performed. No PDFs were uploaded, no `question_bank` import or public display was introduced, no provider/VLM calls were made, and no source/rights/acceptance/release state was mutated. Campaign A #1550 was not changed.\n\n## Known baseline-only check\n\n`npm run quality:public-launch-copy` reports the existing `src/pages/paper-workspace/content/i18n.js:211 official scoring` finding on both this branch and the clean root `main` worktree. This PR does not modify that unrelated surface.\n\nCloses #1566","created_at":"2026-07-15T09:31:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T02:13:58Z","closed_at":"2026-07-16T02:13:58Z","merged_at":"2026-07-16T02:13:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"c85d031991e6d7905dadd52ab015633b08b6324e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1571/commits","review_comm